      <data key="d5">resumen</data>
      <data key="d6">en</data>
      <data key="d7">Researchers and farmer cooperatives assessed circular bioeconomy pathways for agricultural residues. The study tested value-added prototypes that generated additional income through implementation and commercialization, analyzed local markets and co-produced a transfer guide for cooperative enterprises.</data>
    </node>
